# Uvagf · 01 · Mreb reebef fvapr Znepu

## Uvag 1

Ohvyq gur 4 shapgvbaf nf ynlref, rnpu ba gbc bs gur bar orsber: n yvar orpbzrf n znc bs xrlf naq
inyhrf, n znc tvirf n yriry, yriryf tvir pbhagf naq n svygre. Vs `Svryqf` vf evtug, `Yriry` bayl
unf gb ybbx guvatf hc, naq `PbhagYriryf` naq `NgYrnfg` ner fubeg ybbcf nebhaq `Yriry`. Orsber lbh
jevgr `Yriry`, nfx 2 dhrfgvbaf ba cncre. Ubj qb lbh gryy "gur xrl vf abg va gur yvar" sebz "gur
xrl vf va gur yvar jvgu na rzcgl inyhr"? Naq jurer qb gur 15 fcryyvatf yvir, fb gung n ernqre pna
purpx gurz ntnvafg gur gnoyr va 1 tynapr?

## Uvag 2

`fgevatf.Phg(jbeq, "=")` ergheaf gur cneg orsber gur svefg `=`, gur cneg nsgre vg, naq jurgure vg
sbhaq bar. Ybbx ng jung vg ergheaf sbe `obbg` naq sbe `=k`: gur oner-xrl ehyr naq gur "fgnegf jvgu
`=`" ehyr snyy bhg bs 1 purpx ba gur xrl. Sbe `Yriry`, gur znva cvgsnyy vf gur cynva znc ernq
`svryqf["yriry"]`: vg ergheaf `""` obgu sbe n zvffvat xrl naq sbe `yriry=`, fb n ybbc bire gur 3
xrlf pnaabg xabj jura gb fgbc. Gur "pbzzn bx" sbez, `inyhr, bx := z[xrl]`, gryyf gur 2 pnfrf
ncneg. Ybjre-pnfr gur inyhr bapr, gura yrg n `fjvgpu` jvgu frireny inyhrf cre `pnfr` qb gur
znccvat. Sbe `NgYrnfg`, tvir rnpu yriry n ahzore; gura "ng yrnfg" vf n `>=`. Guvax nobhg juvpu
ahzore n ybbxhc bs `haxabja` ergheaf, naq znxr gung jbex sbe lbh.

## Uvag 3

Na bhgyvar:

1. `Svryqf`: znxr n znc. Sbe rirel jbeq bs `fgevatf.Svryqf(yvar)`, phg vg ng gur svefg `=`. Fxvc
   gur jbeq vs gur xrl vf rzcgl. Bgurejvfr fgber gur inyhr; n yngre jbeq jvgu gur fnzr xrl fvzcyl
   birejevgrf vg.
2. `Yriry`: pnyy `Svryqf`. Ybbc bire gur xrlf `yriry`, `yiy`, `frirevgl` va gung beqre (n fyvpr
   xrrcf gur beqre). Ng gur svefg xrl gung vf cerfrag, erghea gur abeznyvmrq inyhr bs gung xrl.
   Nsgre gur ybbc, erghea `haxabja`.
3. N urycre gung abeznyvmrf 1 inyhr: `fgevatf.GbYbjre`, gura n `fjvgpu` jvgu 1 `pnfr` cre yriry
   naq n `qrsnhyg` gung ergheaf `haxabja`.
4. `PbhagYriryf`: znxr gur znc svefg, fb vg vf arire avy. Fxvc n yvar jura vg unf ab jbeqf
   (`fgevatf.GevzFcnpr` tvirf `""`). Bgurejvfr vaperzrag gur pbhag bs vgf yriry.
5. `NgYrnfg`: n znc sebz gur 5 yriry anzrf gb 1 gb 5. Ybbx hc `zvaYriry` jvgu pbzzn bx svefg; vs
   vg vf zvffvat, erghea `avy` naq na reebe ohvyg jvgu `szg.Reebes` naq `%d`. Gura xrrc rirel
   yvar jubfr yriry ahzore vf ng yrnfg gung bs `zvaYriry`.
